WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, we've talked about
the news already,

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
so here to address
something more personal,

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:06.539
please welcome one of my
writers, Jenny Hagel, everybody.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.109 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
How's it going, Jenny?
-Hi, Seth.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:13.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, what is it
that you want to talk about?

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:17.150
-Well, this weekend, I took
my 4-year-old son to the zoo,

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.051 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and while we were there,

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
I saw something
that really upset me.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:20.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And what was that?
-While I was in line

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:23.723 size:78% position:39%
to buy tickets, I saw
two straight women

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:27.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
pretend to be gay so they
could get a family discount.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
-Yeah, I'm gay,

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.432 size:78% position:39%
and it was very clear
that they were lying.

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when the ticket agent
didn't believe them,

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.069 line:92%
they started yelling loudly

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:38.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
about how the zoo
was not gay friendly.

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did it work?
Did they get the discount?

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:40.840 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-They did not.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.178
They had to pay 8 more dollars,
and they were pissed.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:49.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, if it's okay with you,
I just wanted to take a moment

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.283 size:75% position:38% line:92%
to deliver a message

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the two women
I saw at the zoo.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.087 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:57.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Don't pretend to be a lesbian
to save $8.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:05.231 line:92%
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought this
went without saying,

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:08.568 line:92%
but apparently it doesn't.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
Apparently,
it requires an announcement

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.072 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and a special graphic.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:16.576
So don't pretend to be a lesbian
to save $8.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:17.143 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.446
I don't think this is something
that's happening a lot,

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:24.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
but just in case it is,
I thought I should say it.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.318 line:92%
Being gay is a real thing.

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:28.321
And while it's a wonderful
experience for many people,

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
it also brings
some real hardship.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:32.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like when I came out,
I had to leave the church

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:34.694
I grew up in
because I wasn't welcome there.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't want
to disparage any church,

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:39.933
so I'll just say that the name
of it rhymes with "matholic."

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:40.467 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:44.237
And it's run by a guy whose name
rhymes with the Schmope.

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:45.004 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.372 line:92%
-Okay, so quick little question.

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
How did you know
they weren't lesbians?

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:49.742 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Great, great question.

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:51.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
They were each pushing
a double stroller,

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:54.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
which means, if they
were married to each other,

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:55.181 size:81% position:41% line:92%
they'd have four kids.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:58.818
No one can afford to have
four kids in New York.

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:00.520 line:92%
You'd have to be billionaires!

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.054 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:02.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if there were
two lesbian billionaires

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:03.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
married to each other
in America,

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:06.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would know about it.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:08.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Still, that doesn't sound
very conclusive.

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. All right.
How about this?

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:12.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
While they were in line,
one of them said to the other,

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:14.200 line:92%
"I've been called for jury duty

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
five times
in the last six months,"

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:17.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the other one was like,
"Oh, my God. Really?"

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:22.509
If you got called for jury duty
five times in six months,

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:24.777 line:92%
your wife would know about it.

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:25.845 line:92%
You wouldn't keep it secret,

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:28.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
quietly getting out of it
five times in a row,

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:32.218
and then finally think, "I need
to tell Brenda about this."

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:32.719 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:35.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
"But I need to wait
until we're at the zoo."

00:02:35.488 --> 00:02:36.456 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:39.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What was your son doing
during all this?

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:40.894 line:92%
-Oh, he was picking his nose.

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:43.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
Does he pick his nose a lot?

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.631 line:92%
-Is the Schmope matholic?

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:51.304 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:52.639 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Look, I get it.

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:54.707 line:92%
Everyone wants to be a lesbian.

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:57.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're seen as very cool,
stylish people

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.344 line:92%
with great shoes and haircuts.

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:01.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know if you're known
for your haircuts?

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:02.348 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, we're not?

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:03.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then why did you
steal one of them?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Touché.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:08.121
-But if there's one thing we can
all take away from the story,

00:03:08.121 --> 00:03:10.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's -- and everyone please
say it with me.

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:15.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't pretend to be a lesbian
to save $8.

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:16.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You got it!
Thank you!

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:20.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Give it up for Jenny Hagel,
everybody!

